{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26942","headline":"和裴令公新成绿野堂即事 · 姚合","name":"和裴令公新成绿野堂即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结构立嘉名，轩窗四面明。\n丘墙高莫比，萧宅僻还清。\n池际龟潜戏，庭前药旋生。\n树深檐稍邃，石峭径难平。\n道旷襟情远，神闲视听精。\n古今功独出，大小隐俱成。\n曙雨新苔色，秋风长桂声。\n携诗就竹写，取酒对花倾。\n古寺招僧饭，方塘看鹤行。\n人间无此贵，半仗暮归城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}